sections.content:
Završivši tumačenje, voditelj najavljuje raspored susreta na kojima se moli krunica, promovira knjiga i predstavlja **domoljubna inicijativa Ora et Labora**. Kaže da je istoga dana u Sinju, a navodi sljedeće termine:

- **četvrtak, 29. listopada – Sinj**, hotel Alkar, Vrlička 50: molitva krunice u 19 sati, zatim promocija knjige i predstavljanje inicijative;
- **petak, 30. listopada – Ljubuški**, hotel Bigeste, Hrvatskih branitelja 69;
- **subota, 31. listopada – Prozor-Rama**, dvorana hidroelektrane Rama, uoči blagdana Svih svetih;
- **ponedjeljak, 2. studenoga – Biograd na Moru**, hotel Ilirija, Tina Ujevića 7;
- **utorak, 3. studenoga – Solin**, hotel President, Ivana Pavla II.;
- **srijeda, 4. studenoga – Imotski**, Pučko otvoreno učilište, Ante Starčevića 7.

Voditelj dodaje da mu ostaje još eventualno jedan slobodan dan. Želio je posjetiti Istru, ali od toga vjerojatno neće biti ništa. Sljedeći tjedan na redu je **Slavonija**.

sections.content_en:
Having finished the interpretation, the host announces the schedule of gatherings where the rosary is prayed, the book is promoted, and the **patriotic initiative Ora et Labora** is presented. He says that he is in Sinj on the same day, and lists the following dates:

- **Thursday, October 29 – Sinj**, Hotel Alkar, Vrlička 50: prayer of the rosary at 7:00 PM, followed by the book promotion and presentation of the initiative;
- **Friday, October 30 – Ljubuški**, Hotel Bigeste, Hrvatskih branitelja 69;
- **Saturday, October 31 – Prozor-Rama**, hall of the Rama hydroelectric power plant, on the eve of the Solemnity of All Saints;
- **Monday, November 2 – Biograd na Moru**, Hotel Ilirija, Tina Ujevića 7;
- **Tuesday, November 3 – Solin**, Hotel President, Ivana Pavla II;
- **Wednesday, November 4 – Imotski**, Public Open University, Ante Starčevića 7.

The host adds that he has possibly one more free day left. He wanted to visit Istra, but that will probably come to nothing. Next week it is the turn of **Slavonija**.
